Let $u, \tilde u$ be the solutions of the Cauchy problems
\begin{equation*}
\left\{\begin{aligned}
&i\partial_tu=-\Delta u+V u+C_1(|\cdot|^{-1}\ast|u|^2)u-a|u|^\sigma u\\
